entry .Mon
  info
      - Monday, exported from `Weekday`
      + lundi, exporté de `Weekday`
  detail
      - The first case of the `Weekday` enum, exported to the package so that `Weekday.count(start,
      - end, Sat)` or `WeekdayOrdinal(Mon, 3)` needs no qualifier. `Mon` to `Sun` are all exported.
      - Which weekday begins the week, and which are the weekend, is the `Hebdomad` in scope.
      + Le premier cas de l'énumération `Weekday`, exporté vers le package pour que
      + `Weekday.count(start, end, Sat)` ou `WeekdayOrdinal(Mon, 3)` n'exige aucun
      + qualificatif. De `Mon` à `Sun`, tous sont exportés. Le jour qui commence la semaine,
      + et ceux qui forment le week-end, relèvent du `Hebdomad` dans la portée.
