entry .IndianMonth
  info
      - the twelve months of the Indian national calendar, and the radix of a span of them
      + les douze mois du calendrier national indien, et la base d'une durée calendaire exprimée
      + en ces mois
  detail
      - `Chaitra`, `Vaishakha`, `Jyeshtha`, `Ashadha`, `Shravana`, `Bhadra`, `Ashwin`, `Kartika`,
      - `Agrahayana`, `Pausha`, `Magha` and `Phalguna`. The companion is a `MonthRadix`.
      + `Chaitra`, `Vaishakha`, `Jyeshtha`, `Ashadha`, `Shravana`, `Bhadra`, `Ashwin`, `Kartika`,
      + `Agrahayana`, `Pausha`, `Magha` et `Phalguna`. Le compagnon est un `MonthRadix`.
