entry .timestampInternal
  info
      - the home of `Timestamp`, `Date` and `Monthstamp`
      + le foyer de `Timestamp`, `Date` et `Monthstamp`
  hidden
  detail
      - Not for direct use: the object which holds the opaque type `Timestamp`, the aliases
      - `Date = Timestamp in Day` and `Monthstamp = Timestamp in Month`, their companions, the
      - givens for all three (which live in `Timestamp`'s companion so that they are in the
      - implicit scope of the one underlying type) and the extensions. It is separate from
      - `internal` so that its accessors do not collide after erasure with those of `Year` and
      - `Day`. The `aviation` pages of `Timestamp`, `Date` and `Monthstamp` have the full
      - account.
      + Pas destiné à un usage direct : l'objet qui contient le type opaque `Timestamp`, les
      + alias `Date = Timestamp in Day` et `Monthstamp = Timestamp in Month`, leurs compagnons,
      + les givens des trois (qui vivent dans le compagnon de `Timestamp` pour être dans la
      + portée implicite de l'unique type sous-jacent) et les extensions. Il est séparé
      + d'`internal` pour que ses accesseurs n'entrent pas en collision, après effacement, avec
      + ceux de `Year` et `Day`. Les pages `aviation` de `Timestamp`, `Date` et `Monthstamp`
      + donnent la description complète.
