        + la cadence d'une `Recurrence` : _every 2 weeks_
  entry #everyUnit
    info
        - the cadence of an `Rrule`: _every month_, _every 3 days_
        + la cadence d'une `Rrule` : _every month_, _every 3 days_
  entry #times
